sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Pelanggan
    participant B as Browser (React)
    participant S as Server (Express)
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant MT as Midtrans API
    participant SK as Socket.io
    participant K as Dashboard Kasir

    P->>B: Scan QR Code di meja
    B->>S: GET /api/menus?available=true
    S->>DB: Query menu tersedia
    DB-->>S: Daftar menu
    S-->>B: Response menu + kategori
    B-->>P: Tampilkan halaman menu

    P->>B: Pilih item & tambah ke keranjang
    P->>B: Tekan "Buat Pesanan"
    B->>S: POST /api/orders {table_id, items[], customer_name}

    S->>DB: Validasi meja & item menu
    S->>S: Hitung total & generate order number
    S->>DB: INSERT order + order_items
    DB-->>S: Order created
    S->>SK: emit("new_order", orderData)
    SK->>K: Notifikasi pesanan baru
    S-->>B: Response {order}

    B->>S: POST /api/payment/create {order_id}
    S->>MT: snap.createTransaction(params)
    MT-->>S: {snap_token, redirect_url}
    S->>DB: UPDATE order SET payment_id
    S-->>B: Response {snap_token}

    B-->>P: Tampilkan popup Midtrans
    P->>MT: Pilih metode & bayar

    MT->>S: POST /api/payment/notification (webhook)
    S->>DB: UPDATE order SET status = "paid"
    S->>SK: emit("order_updated")
    SK->>K: Update status di dashboard
    SK->>B: Update status di tracking
    S-->>MT: Response 200 OK

    K->>S: PATCH /api/orders/:id/status {status: "processing"}
    S->>DB: UPDATE order status
    S->>SK: emit("order_updated")
    SK->>B: Status: Diproses
    B-->>P: Notifikasi real-time

    K->>S: PATCH /api/orders/:id/status {status: "completed"}
    S->>DB: UPDATE order status
    S->>SK: emit("order_updated")
    SK->>B: Status: Selesai ✅
    B-->>P: Pesanan selesai!
